This product includes adaptations of NimBLE transport mechanics from
espressif/esp-desktop-buddy, commit
b6bac05db208717676e70180e5269d79f32b2d68, licensed under Apache-2.0.

The adapted source areas are the pinned transport component's
`buddy_transport_ble.c`, `buddy_transport_ble_gap.c`,
`buddy_transport_ble_gatt.c`, and `buddy_transport_ble_tx.c`, together with
its public transport header and private transport state header. This project
replaces the source API, service identifiers, RX ownership, TX queue, security
facts, and lifecycle handling. No Buddy core, message model, or semantic
transport port is included.

The pinned source tree contains a root LICENSE and no NOTICE file.
